WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.434
-Well, guys, it seems like
there's so much

00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:04.601
going on right now.

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.033
The NFL Draft kicked off
tonight in Las Vegas.

00:00:06.033 --> 00:00:10.100
That's right. Elon Musk is
buying Twitter for $44 billion.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:13.100
We got our first look at the
sequel to "Avatar."

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:16.334
And Chipotle says that they want
to start offering dessert.

00:00:16.334 --> 00:00:18.133
There's a lot to go over.

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:20.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:23.033
So let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:23.033 --> 00:00:24.901
It's time for a "News Smash."
Here we go.

00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:26.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:30.334 --> 00:00:33.634
First up, the NFL Draft got
under way tonight in Las Vegas.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.067
The best
college football players

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.834
are heading to the pros,
where they're going to make

00:00:36.834 --> 00:00:39.167
a lot of money,
almost enough money to...

00:00:39.167 --> 00:00:40.801
buy Twitter.

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:45.801
Elon Musk is buying
the company for $44 billion.

00:00:45.801 --> 00:00:48.434
The whole thing came together
really fast, unlike...

00:00:48.434 --> 00:00:49.667
"Avatar 2."

00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:53.000
It's been
13 years in the making.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.400
And they're calling it
"The Way of Water,"

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.334
which is also what you hear from
the bathroom after eating...

00:00:58.334 --> 00:00:59.968
Chipotle dessert.

00:00:59.968 --> 00:01:03.133
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.667
Word of warning --
don't stand behind anyone

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.534
who eats it
or you might feel a...

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.100
draft.

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.534
[ Laughter, applause ]

00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:14.033
Hey, Tom Brady wasn't picked
until the sixth round.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:16.734
He waited longer to get drafted
than we've waited for...

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:19.467
"Avatar 2."

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.901
Those "Avatar" characters have
some unusual names,

00:01:21.901 --> 00:01:25.501
like Neytiri, Mo'at, and...

00:01:25.501 --> 00:01:28.434
Elon Musk.

00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:30.200
He's taking
a big risk with Twitter

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.501
and he might regret it,
kind of like eating...

00:01:32.501 --> 00:01:34.534
Chipotle dessert.

00:01:34.534 --> 00:01:37.200
If it's anything like the guac,
it'll cost...

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.901
$44 billion.

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.567
So, in conclusion...

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:44.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:46.200 --> 00:01:47.734
So, in conclusion...

00:01:47.734 --> 00:01:49.701
welcome to the NFL...

00:01:49.701 --> 00:01:51.801
welcome to a living hell...

00:01:51.801 --> 00:01:54.267
finally here, what a shocker...

00:01:54.267 --> 00:01:56.234
think ahead, call a doctor.

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:58.501
This has been a "News Smash."

00:01:58.501 --> 00:02:00.567
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

